  "description": "Aspose HTML SDK for C++ is a programming SDK that allows software developers to manipulate and convert HTML documents from within their own applications. A Wrapper of RESTful APIs, Aspose HTML SDK for C++ speeds up HTML programming and conversion.\nAspose Html SDK for C++ is a cross-platform C++ library that enables your applications to perform a great range of html document processing tasks. With Aspose.Html C++ you can load, save and convert html, epub, mhtml, md documents between the following formats: PDF, XPS, DOCX, MD, JPG, GIF, BMP, PDF, TIFF, WEBP, MHTML. Vectorize images to SVG format.",
